From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bjorn Andersson <bjorn.andersson@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 20:54:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: qcom: scm: Allow QSEECOM on Asus Zenbook A14
 (UX3407NA)

In line with other Glymur-based machines, the Asus Zenbook A14
(UX3407NA) exposes EFI variables through the "uefisecapp". Add it to the
QSEECOM allowlist to enable this access.

Reviewed-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Bjorn Andersson <bjorn.andersson@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Abel Vesa <abel.vesa@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260915-zenbook-dts-v2-3-41de8669a7a8@oss.qualcomm.com
Signed-off-by: Bjorn Andersson <andersson@kernel.org>
---
 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
index 08483ca..61c1348 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
@@ -2305,6 +2305,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "acer,aspire-a16-11m" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,vivobook-s15" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,vivobook-s15-x1p4" },
+	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-a14-ux3407na" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-a14-ux3407qa" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-a14-ux3407ra" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-a16-ux3607oa" },
